ault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-08-24T06:05:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T09:10:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122757","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122757.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122757.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes (partially) https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14841\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds a News tab to the Project Manager that displays the latest news from the Godot website. The news feed is fetched from the Godot RSS feed when online access is enabled. News items display their title, publication date, a shortened description & a link to read the full article in the user's browser. The news feed is loaded asynchronously using `HTTPClient` & parsed using `XMLParser`, so the Project Manager UI is not blocked while fetching the feed.\r\n\r\nWe don't have an icon for `News` yet. I have contacted @Nodragem & hopefully he can share the one he was using in the mockup.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> This PR focuses on the basic News tab & doesn't include the notification banner or related filtering/notification functionality. Those will be handled in follow-up PRs, as they require additional functionality that isn't part of this initial implementation.\r\n \r\n### Showcase:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97ed0ea1-edef-4b43-8c3c-c042e46252a9\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97756c52-61ab-4d6b-a3a4-eaa8d5780d2b\r\n\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure:\r\nThis PR doesn't use AI, it's all human written code & same goes for the desc 🙃\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122757/reactions","total_count":23,"+1":10,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":4,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122757/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}